WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.669
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright is Not Allowed

00:00:04.669 --> 00:00:07.979
to Play "Hippocratic Oath Chicken" with the
Medical Staff!

00:00:07.979 --> 00:00:12.299
The Hippocratic Oath is deeply important to
all medical professionals, including those

00:00:12.299 --> 00:00:14.349
on staff at the SCP Foundation.

00:00:14.349 --> 00:00:18.460
Dr. Bright is not permitted to try and convince
the medical staff to break the Hippocratic

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:19.800
Oath in any way.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:24.340
He is especially not allowed to expose them
to potentially dangerous anomalies while taunting,

00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:26.060
"Still want to do no harm?

00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:27.060
You sure?"

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:30.990
It's a waste of time, resources, and it's
just plain rude.

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:35.000
One of these days, they're going to snap and
slap him across the face and not one of us

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:35.910
will stop them.

